00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:09.074 align:start size:84% position:16%
29, 30 years old, I
got ahold of this book

00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:10.309
that's very hard
to get ahold of.

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:11.477
He wrote a couple books.

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:12.979 align:start size:84% position:16%
One is called
"Pushing Up People."

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.647
Another one is called, "All
You Can Do Is All You Can Do,

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.149
But All You Can Do Is Enough!"

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:18.084
But this book is not a, like,
you can't buy it bookstores.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:21.187
So I got ahold of it, and
it said never feel guilty.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:26.259 align:start size:97% position:3%
I'm like, "Never feel guilty,
never feel guilty," wow.

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:28.595
Hey, that guy's gotta
pay the price as well.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.062 align:start size:84% position:16%
If he says he's
got this big dream,

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:31.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
he's gotta pay the price,
so never feel guilty.

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:34.167
(pensive music)

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:39.739
- PBD.

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:41.207
- Yes.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:45.545 align:start size:97% position:3%
