first guest in my new studio,

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm very happy to
have you here, my friend.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:50.417 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Well, first of
all, congratulations
place looks amazing,

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:51.718
and thanks for having me, man.

