00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.212 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's part of he
kind of whole thing

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:21.213
that has given you success.

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:22.415
- I would say so.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.183 align:start size:81% position:19%
I think, you know,
you gotta know

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.586 align:start size:84% position:16%
