00:03:21.099 --> 00:03:22.902 align:start size:97% position:3%
You know, I'm asking you,
what are these VHS, you know,

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:25.171
from standup to now being one

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:26.939
of the most powerful
voices out there, man.

00:03:26.939 --> 00:03:28.407
It's great to see
