00:03:36.949 --> 00:03:39.919 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean, those days when I
was doing that, I was broke.

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:42.287 align:start size:84% position:16%
I mean broke I
didn't have 50 bucks.

